  "body": "## What changed\r\n\r\n- Add a 2D Chamfer `Tip offset` setting.\r\n- Offset closed loops and selected open chains toward physical air.\r\n- Lower the virtual tool tip by `(tip offset + chamfer width) * tan(angle)`.\r\n- Keep the active cone band between the tip offset and the chamfer outer radius.\r\n- Refuse offsets that fold, disappear, use the wrong Side, cross material, exceed the tool radius, or exceed flute reach.\r\n- Keep the `EdgeBreak` on the original selected edge with the authored width and depth.\r\n- Add UI help, project version 74 migration, project round-trip support, and MCP create/edit/read support.\r\n- Keep zero offset as the exact legacy closed-loop and open-chain path.\r\n- Keep `minimum_cone_radius` as the project and MCP field name for file compatibility.\r\n\r\nStacked on #3059. This branch starts at the #3059 head and must follow that PR.\r\n\r\n## How tested\r\n\r\n- Focused motion tests: the final cone band, closed-loop Side, open-chain air side, zero compatibility, and offset refusals pass.\r\n- Focused app tests: tool radius, flute reach, project JSON, project migration, and default compatibility pass.\r\n- Focused MCP test: create, patch, read, save, and reset to zero pass.\r\n- Focused UI tests pass:\r\n  - `chamfer_geometry_exposes_tip_offset`\r\n  - `tilted_corner_note_uses_the_same_local_frame_as_its_top_row`\r\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed.\r\n- Child quick gate against `fork/issue/2988-chamfer-open-edge-chains`:\r\n  - 679 of 681 steps passed.\r\n  - 6,407 tests passed, 107 were ignored, and 3 failed.\r\n  - Every #3153 Chamfer suite passed.\r\n  - The failures are unrelated baseline geometry-import tests:\r\n    - `discontinuous_swept_curve_is_refused_by_name`: `missing entity #202`\r\n    - `discontinuous_edge_curve_is_refused_by_name`: `missing entity #200`\r\n    - `an_incomplete_dialect_and_a_four_axis_angle_cut_are_refused_by_name`: `the fixture lost its uv code`\r\n\r\n## Not exercised\r\n\r\n- The heavy plan reaches every motion and app heavy target. The heavy lanes did not run.\r\n- No manual GUI test ran on this final head.\r\n- `graphify update` did not run because `graphify` is not available on `PATH`.\r\n\r\nChangelog: A 2D Chamfer can select a tip offset and cut through that cone band while preserving the authored chamfer width.\r\n\r\nEffort: high\r\n\r\nFixes #3153\r\n",
